{"code": 1, "data": {"currentItemCount": 6, "index": 187, "itemList": [{"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2558/content00896?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong>#<span style=\"color: #c91623; text-decoration: underline;\">一体化</span>供应链-标准解决方案</strong></em></span></a> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">行业痛点与方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">行业痛点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;1 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>人工作业成本越来越高仓储效率要求越来越高</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;2 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>面对不同业务需要使用不同类型的自动化设备，多种设备类型集成复杂度高</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;3 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>对于无人化的自动化物流场景，需要及时的异常监控及处理</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;1 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过智能化设备集成替代人工作业，实现少人化或无人化的场景应用，提升生产作业效率</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>支持20+种主流自动化设备集成，通过配置化方式实现多种设备的串联集成及调度策略</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>支持2D&amp;3D多种方式可视化监控，通过实时的异常监控能力和完整的异常处理能力保证现场稳定生产</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">配置化项目落地</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">通过对通信接口、业务流程、任务策略的全过程配置化方式实施交付，并通过实际场景还原搭建的方式快速绘制物流场景，绘制完成后通过适当的参数设置即可完成自动化物流场景的系统实现，可快速完成自动化物流场景的交付。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/120856/9/33932/206425/63ee0552F1fa2d3a2/edb4286c4098665f.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">智能调度</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">系统内置丰富的策略算法包，可为不同场景提供不同的策略算法，实现不同的调度管理需求。并且可通过参数化形式调整配置，现场生产运行时可根据实际生产情况调整参数，以满足最优化生产效率。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/123122/30/35143/85112/63ee0564F02ba2ff7/088cfd152eb403c0.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">全面可视化监控</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">通过2D3D多维度可视化方式实现对物流现场的实时动态展示，实现对任务流程、设备状态、位置状态等要素的全面监控，快速定位物流状态及异常信息，可全方面满足客户在不同场景的不同监控需求，保障物流生产的稳定运行。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/217671/9/25593/133545/63ee057eF938307f8/58ab2bef4789d13e.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">成功案例</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">某乳制品智能仓库项目</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">某乳制品智能仓库项目是智能产业园内打造高度自动化、省人化、智能化且效率与成本领先的现代化全国物流配送中心。在本项目中，通过集成堆垛机、提升机、输送线、机械臂、AGV、RGV等多种自动化设备，管理47000余个储位2200余种SKU，实现多种设备协同作业。并设计了机械臂自动化拣货，实现仓内全流程自动化无人拣货场景，解决了人员拣货慢、出错率高的问题，实现了多SKU、小批量商品集中自动混码出库场景，提升了出库作业效率。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/60306/11/24245/72360/63ee0598F3a3b96d6/cb857eb85f0c329c.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/157748/33/34601/43354/63f2dadaF8cc91f8a/e24cb76206c61e99.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01051", "contentTitle": "软件产品-京东物控WCS", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1676426165000, "id": 2847, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "resCode": "100097", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/139581/30/33905/9628/63ef4e04F37a13b5f/4daa28779e784608.png", "updateTime": 1676860128000}, {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2558/content00896?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong>#<span style=\"color: #c91623; text-decoration: underline;\">一体化</span>供应链-标准解决方案</strong></em></span></a> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">行业痛点与方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">行业痛点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;1 </span></strong></span></span></em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">自动化项目客户现场10+种设备分散监控</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong></span>自动化项目客户现场10+设备厂商分散监控</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong></span>自动化项目设备厂商多提供2D监控、报表类监控</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;1 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>聚合10+种高保真设备三维模型进行一站式监控</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过京东物控实时采集设备运行数据，支持近28种主流自动化设备的标准对接及交付</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>采用自研3D建模技术构建出1:1还原实际生产场景的二维可视化监控，且支持从大屏到PC到移动端多平台操作</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">智能仓3D可视化解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">基于京东物流科技多年智能仓领域丰富经验，团队自主研发3D引擎，拥有55+高质量，高精度的智能仓三维模型资源；参考客户现场复杂、不标准、不直观、不可视的监控场景系统担任智能仓储&ldquo;管家&rdquo;角色，通过对仓储监控流程的标准化定义，实现对仓内大型自动化设备数据、物联网终端数据、企业信息系统数据等的实时采集、展示、分析以及决策。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/122934/27/34743/168941/63ec7cbcFf9719584/e5655b48e34cfe79.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">智能园区3D可视化解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">针对园区复杂人车场场景管理，支持从人到仓到车到能源能耗的全场景3D可视化监控，此外凭借<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><a style=\"color: #c91623;\" href=\"/materialControl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">京东物控</a></span>云部署能力支持园区多仓同平台统一监控，解决单仓信息孤岛现象升管理运营效率。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/30737/33/20357/142871/63ec7cc7F4c73bf8f/b2e77750e3d18dac.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">针对中小企业客户3D可视化解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">基于物控平台产套标准化应用服务，针对中小型有自动化信息化、数字化升级诉求预算较低的客户，提供3D编辑器支持简易式&ldquo;拖拉拽&rdquo;搭建场景一键发布即运行的代运营服务性价比优越。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/190066/38/31870/154671/63ec7ccfF388ba718/ec08ec9979ba31c3.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">成功案例</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">某智能厨卫制造头部客户</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在智能厨卫制造行业利用3D可视化技术实现双自动化库区30000多储位、1000多台设备的3D全场景重现与监控，采用&ldquo;设备报警&rdquo;、&ldquo;资源报警&rdquo;等多种报警机制监控仓储作业全域异常，实现场景货、物状态直观可视、设备和物流动线逼真模拟，一屏掌握全局，以简驭繁，提升客户运营效率。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/125023/21/28754/214615/63ec7cd8Fef735b0a/ab8a441cea6dfe89.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/188716/40/32340/43354/63f2dab1Fe68f5b42/bf7ec95adb56abae.png\" /></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01050", "contentTitle": "软件产品-京东物控 3D SCADA", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1676426136000, "id": 2846, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "resCode": "100097", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/65080/31/24827/12263/63ef4da0F513f539b/da6426ba13478e89.png", "updateTime": 1677114993000}, {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">操作步骤如下：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">1、使用搜索引擎（例如百度）搜索关键词“京东物流”，点击进入官网，或点击 <a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><s